- Classification tag: `[VALID]`, `[FIXED]`, `[FALSE POSITIVE]`, `[SUPPRESSED]`
- File:line reference (for line-level) or `[top-level]` (for top-level)
- One-line body summary
- Permalink URL (the `html_url` field)

